{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2023-02-09 07:10:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL REPORTS 4TH QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'S&P GLOBAL DEMONSTRATED RESILIENCE IN BOTH THE 4TH QUARTER, AND THE FULL-YEAR 2022 COMPLETED MERGER WITH IHS MARKIT ACHIEVED 2022 MERGER-RELATED SYNERGY TARGETS AHEAD OF SCHEDULE ANNOUNCED DIVESTITURE OF ENGINEERING SOLUTIONS COMPLETED $12 BILLION ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE INTRODUCED NEW STRATEGIC VISION AND MULTI-YEAR FINANCIAL TARGET MODEL AT THE 2022 INVESTOR DAY \xa0 NEW YORK , FEB. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL (NYSE: SPGI) TODAY REPORTED FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2022 RESULTS. THE COMPANY REPORTED FOURTH QUARTER 2022 REPORTED REVENUE OF $2.94 BILLION, AN INCREASE OF 41% COMPARED TO THE SAME PERIOD IN 2021.'}